WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
The next generation of internet. Not a new website. A new way to use one.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Bring a document or a video. Ursly reads it, and answers only from it.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Voice to action. Say it, and Ursly does it.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Motion to action. In beta, built for the headsets coming next.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
The keyboard still works. It is simply no longer the way in.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Nothing ships until the loop closes. Concept to production, tested in production, every cycle.
